# Language statistics for GitHub Linguist.
# This repo is a Python analysis kit; the following are excluded so the language
# bar reflects the actual source:
#   - third-party TeX macro packages / bibliography style (vendored copies)
#   - research notes and redundant write-ups
#   - generated experiment results under runs/
# The submission source (paper/main.tex) is intentionally NOT excluded.
*.sty linguist-vendored
*.bst linguist-vendored
notes/** linguist-documentation
paper/draft.md linguist-documentation
paper/preliminary_results.md linguist-documentation
runs/** linguist-generated
